# CURSOR PROJECT RULES - ZENITH TRAINER

**Version:** 1.0.0  
**Project:** Zenith Trainer - AI-Driven Fitness Platform  
**Last Updated:** November 15, 2025
**Current Stage:** 4.2.1 Complete (65-70% MVP Ready)

---

## 🎯 PROJECT OVERVIEW

**Zenith Trainer** is an AI-powered fitness tracking platform with unique features:
- **ZTL DSL** (Zenith Training Language) - YAML-based program description
- **Bidirectional AI Workflow** - Export → Claude/Gemini Analysis → Import recommendations
- **Comprehensive Analytics** - Recharts visualizations, RPE tracking, volume analysis
- **Habit Tracker 2.0** - Multi-dimensional life tracking (in progress)

**Tech Stack:**
- Frontend: Next.js 15 (App Router), React 18, TypeScript strict mode
- Backend: Firebase 11 (Auth, Firestore, Storage)
- AI: Genkit AI 1.20 + Google Gemini API
- UI: Radix UI (17 components) + Tailwind CSS
- Charts: Recharts, DnD: @dnd-kit

